# A claimant asks about coverage and prepares a claim.
typing-speed 40ms
highlight 300ms

persona claimant
new-conversation
send "A kaiju stepped on my car in the harbour last night. Am I covered under policy KP-1001?"
wait-idle 3m
reply

send "Please prepare the claim: one crushed car, 18000 EUR."
wait-idle 3m
prepare-claim
wait-idle 3m
state
